<tr><td colspan=2>SSSRARRRRR BLOODHORDE !<br>
Recently I have completed the first small steps of my epic, among those acquired the Shield of Falsehood, and I have also obtained quite a few of the items I will be needing for the last part. There is one thing which still has to be done before I can progress, and I think I have come to the point where I should do that part now.<br>
<br>
The next step after aquiring the shield, is killing the Black Dire in Castle Mistmoore. I will need help, for he is not easy prey for a lone hunter. <br>
I have spoken of this in guildchat if only briefly, and I have set a date. <br>
<br>
The date is <b>Saturday the 14th of July</b>, the time is as follows: <br>
<b>noon PST <br>
2pm CST <br>
9pm CET<br>
</b><br>
I hope these times are correct, it will be at 8 pm GMT if you rather want to find the time yourself, if I made a mistake in converting please post the correct times here. <br>
<br>
Hopefully Kloth can make it to be our puller, and Gumkak to be one of the guys taking 200 dmg per hit *smiles*<br>
<br>
Please post a reply saying whether you're available or not, as I will need to know what classes and levels we get, so I can try to get more people if we will need them.<br>
<br>
Achzizra Jarik'bor<br>
