<tr><td colspan=2>Thank you my family, for coming to my aid *smiles*<br>
<br>
I will need someone familiar with Mistmoore to command the raid. I have not travelled far into the softskin lands, and it would not do if I made mistakes due to my shortage on knowledge. (;ooc; I have walked through the entire zone in the zone viewer but that does not count, I do not know where the mobs are, if they wander, how the pathing is .. If you're unable to make it but know important info about MM, send me a tell ingame, any help is good.)<br>
<br>
From what I can tell from the eqatlas and the eqbestiary pages, this area is roughly levels 20 to 36, with a few exceptions. If this is correct there should be good reason to have a group for our Blood Fists as well, if not more, and really turn this into a big family event.<br>
<br>
I believe that with the people I have spoken to so far, we could take the Dire down. I'll list them here for our convenience, although many have said it's *almost* sure, I hope everyone will be able to make it. If not.. it will be interesting. *grins*<br>
<br>
The following people are coming:<br>
<B>Lazier, Freyja, ULUL, Rekka, Gumkak, Kloth, Jezelle, Slackjaw, Dizeez, Pustule, Boilybut, Rauk, Zmaka and Noxxer</B>, a 47th season cleric from Edge of Darkness.<br>
<br>
Of course all pending RL catastrophies and the like :)<br>
<br>
I am also hoping to see more of the family there, Gaki, Vanc, Kaelas, Gnadira, Slayfang, Zherron, Valkiira, Kerili, Aael, Alex and anyone and everyone else who'd like to kick some butt in Mistmoore. (I would list you all but then this post would be too long!) If we stay long enough and Razorr comes too perhaps we can get her a pelt from the Black Dire as well, that would be good. :) <br>
<br>
After we are done, if people are able to come with me to EJ that would be great, as I have to speak with a spirit in an area with wandering mobs, and might need some help. <br>
<br>
See you the 14th!<br>
<br>
SSRARRRRRRRR BLOODHORDE !<br>
