Oh!  one thing i wantd to mention:  one of the biggest obsticles the bloodhorde faced on its last raid of MM was GETTING THROUGH LESSER FEY.  it was shocking to me how few of us actually knew the way there, but made sence i spose considering ot alot of evils dont bother visiting the stinky island.  anyway, i cant remember exactly how many died trying to reach MM, but its definatly in the 10 to 20 + range.  due partly to lack of kowledge, and mostly to lack of listening.  though ive read alot of posts here recently extoling the virtues of how well BH does on its raids now, so hopfully that wont be an issue this time around.  <br>
<br>
hope to see us spill much stinky vampire blood<br>
